const summary =
  "Mechanical Engineering graduate of Gadjah Mada University (GPA 3.58/4.00) with hands-on experience across manufacturing and tooling environments: production engineering in a wood-products plant, tool making and machining section leadership in agricultural machinery, and maintenance and inspection in cement manufacturing. Skilled in machining processes, jig and fixture design, measuring instruments, materials engineering, robotics, and industrial equipment maintenance and inspection. Also competent in desktop and web application programming, which supports the development of efficient and innovative technical solutions, including shop-floor tools for CNC program generation, tool-room control, and daily work planning. Final-year thesis on punch speed and compressor pressure effects on sheared-edge quality in aluminium alloy 1100.";

